  "details": "Hello VRChat Support,\n\nI recently migrated/merged my old platform account with my full VRChat account, and after that my progress in the world “FISH!” was reset.\n\nMy old account name was: бездарь 428b\n\nMy new VRChat account name is: бездаръ\n\nThe account migration was done about two days ago.\n\nAfter the migration, all my persistence data in the “FISH!” world disappeared. My level, progress, items, and fishing data were reset back to the beginning.\n\nCould you please check if my FISH! world persistence data is still connected to my old platform profile and manually transfer or restore it to my new VRChat account?\n\nThank you very much.",
